Hi {{first_name}},

{{stage_label}} — the following library item is overdue:

  Item:          {{book_title}}
  Was due:       {{due_date}}
  Days overdue:  {{days_overdue}}
  Charge so far: {{fine_so_far}}

Please return it to the library desk as soon as possible. Overdue charges continue to accrue each day until it is returned, up to the per-item cap.

If you have already returned this item, please reply so we can correct our records.

{{system_name}} Library
